[{"id":4889611262,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI3GL_g","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Approved in meeting.\r\n\r\nThe only bug I ran into is that the step on the animation_slider is hardcoded to 1/100.0 on line 1848:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\tanimation_slider->set_step(1.0 / 100.0);\r\n```\r\nThis needs to be corrected to use `set_step(1.0 / animation_fps)` and updated in all the places that `animation_fps` changes.\r\n\r\nTo reproduce the bug, set animation fps to 120 in import settings, and scroll through the spinbox up and down, and you will see it skips lots of frames sometimes, due to bouncing back and forth from spinbox to slider (with the wrong step)","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#pullrequestreview-4889611262","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117576","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#pullrequestreview-4889611262"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117576"}},"submitted_at":"2026-08-08T20:17:04Z","